diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 74e3e175..a9bbcb7f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,0 +10,21 @@ interfaces may change between releases.
+## [0.0.31] - 2026-10-26
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Finish an expired Run deadline while awaiting provider admission as the existing
+  wall-time budget outcome, without dispatching a request or swallowing other errors.
+- Preserve deferred provider-admission lifecycle events with protocol-valid reason
+  codes; retain strict validation and bounded permit cleanup.
+- Follow the shared host implementation in release, ownership, effect-boundary,
+  schema consumer, and evolution checks after the CLI/host split.
+- Remove strict Clippy failures without lint exemptions, and repair outdated
+  persistence fixtures, optional-diagnostic assumptions, and terminal-export races.
+- Refresh generated tuning inventories and strict documentation links while retaining
+  stable registry identities and fail-closed ownership checks.
+
+### Release verification
+
+- This changelog entry prepares a release; it does not establish publication or
+  acceptance. Exact-commit CI, complete release preflight, human review, artifact
+  verification, and installer canaries remain required before release acceptance.
+
